ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_Placard::
    .string "7F  ERROR\p"
    .string "Being wrong, and why that is where\n"
    .string "the change happens.\p"
    .string "The last floor. The syllabus is\n"
    .string "on the desk.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_Syllabus::
    .string "COURSE SYLLABUS\n"
    .string "7F  ERROR\p"
    .string "TOPICS: SURPRISE, CORRECTION,\n"
    .string "STEPS, MISTAKES, CERTAINTY.\p"
    .string "All of it is on the board.\n"
    .string "The exam covers the board.\p"
    .string "PASS MARK: 80 out of 100.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_Surprise::
    .string "SURPRISE\p"
    .string "A mind is always guessing what\n"
    .string "comes next.\p"
    .string "Surprise is the size of the miss.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_Correction::
    .string "CORRECTION\p"
    .string "Learning is mostly correcting.\p"
    .string "The bigger the miss, the bigger\n"
    .string "the correction.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_Steps::
    .string "STEPS\p"
    .string "Correct too much at once and you\n"
    .string "overshoot.\p"
    .string "Small corrections, many times,\n"
    .string "get closer.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_Mistakes::
    .string "MISTAKES\p"
    .string "A mistake you notice teaches more\n"
    .string "than an answer you were given.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_Certainty::
    .string "CERTAINTY\p"
    .string "Being sure is not evidence.\p"
    .string "Nothing surprises the surest, so\n"
    .string "they learn the least.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_Onpurpose::
    .string "I got one wrong on purpose, so I\n"
    .string "would learn something.\p"
    .string "I am not sure that is how it works.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_Certain::
    .string "I was certain about the last\n"
    .string "question.\p"
    .string "That is why I am up here again.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_TeacherGive::
    .string "You have come all the way up.\p"
    .string "Here. Every board in the building\n"
    .string "is in this.\p"
    .string "Read it anywhere. Nobody here\n"
    .string "will mind.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_TeacherJoke::
    .string "Wrong! Wonderful.\p"
    .string "No, I mean it. Look how wrong.\p"
    .string "...I cannot explain why that is\n"
    .string "good. It is on the board.$"

ViridianCity_School_7F_Text_ReceivedTextbook::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the TEXTBOOK.$"
